1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Spell 30B speaks directly
to the heart.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,200
In an old translation,
it begins, My heart my mother.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,700
Modern translators read it
as a plea

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,567
that the heart not speak
against its owner.

5
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:16,667
On this heart scarab,
the museum identifies

6
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,300
ten lines as Spell 30B.
